      ],
      "impact": "The SSD1306 charge pump is designed for a 1 µF flying capacitor; a 4.7 µF part changes the pump's switching behaviour and can prevent the panel bias rail from reaching its specified level, degrading or disabling the OLED display.",
      "confidence": 0.55
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic largely matches the intended Portal design, but the SSD1306 charge-pump flying capacitor on C1P/C1N is drawn as 4.7 µF instead of the specified 1 µF, a value deviation that can affect the OLED bias supply."
}

